# Local Vivado workspaces. Keep all shared design sources at the repository root.
/.vivado/

# Vivado project infrastructure and generated directories.
**/.Xil/
**/*.cache/
**/*.gen/
**/*.hw/
**/*.ip_user_files/
**/*.runs/
**/*.sim/
**/*.srcs/
**/managed_ip_project/

